* exported tree: lower-case keywords, comments, unindented continuations
TOP + F1 F2 ; initiator branch, flag branch
  G4
F1 * IE-1 X1 X3
F2 * X2 C
G4 2 B1 B2
B3
endtree trailing words
process TOP
import
  .5 B1
  5.E-1 B2
  1.0D-01 B3
  2.E-1 C
  1.E-02 IE-1 I
  -1.000000E+00 X1
  -1 X2
  -1.0 X3 ; flag
limit 1.E-12
maxsize 3
